{"ts": 1791255218.5810418, "type": "step", "step": 16, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Quick check: for the Friday build, the eval section is probably asking you to distinguish the **thing you care about** from the **metric you can easily measure**. A quiz score is a proxy; direct evidence is closer to the actual goal. In your writeup, you may want to say your evaluation uses a metric that is a proxy for reliability, and then note the limitation. After you finish reading, I can help you draft the exact sentence(s).", "intent": "hint", "concept": "evaluating agents"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: wait, I'm lost on pass^k\n[activity] t=15 messages 2m", "t": 17, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.296727034588242, "pomdp": 0.296727034588242, "pass_k": 0.390012058925386}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.5794114428006399, "motivation": 0.44783718433757524, "reliance": 0.33294461262462643, "persistence": 0.4671650147483821, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.28910681059556054, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3019095011780912, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255220.098866, "type": "step", "step": 17, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Totally fair \u2014 here\u2019s the simple version:\n\n- **pass@k** = if you try k times, did **at least one** try work?\n- **pass^k** = if you try k times, did **every one** of the k tries work?\n\nSo if the build says **pass^k**, it\u2019s asking for consistency/reliability, not just one lucky success.\n\nExample: if k=3 and results are success, fail, success:\n- pass@3 = yes\n- pass^3 = no\n\nIf you want, I can help you write the eval sentence for your build using that distinction.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluating agents"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: I don't really get pass^k yet\n[activity] t=17 messages 4m", "t": 21, "activity": [{"t": 17, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.296727034588242, "pomdp": 0.296727034588242, "pass_k": 0.42879840260501423}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.5794114428006399, "motivation": 0.44783718433757524, "reliance": 0.33294461262462643, "persistence": 0.4671650147483821, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.28910681059556054, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3019095011780912, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255220.7817678, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 21, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.296727034588242, "pomdp": 0.296727034588242, "pass_k": 0.42879840260501423}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.5794114428006399, "motivation": 0.44783718433757524, "reliance": 0.33294461262462643, "persistence": 0.4671650147483821, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.28910681059556054, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3019095011780912, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
