{"ts": 1791255223.3040562, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s make it concrete. Suppose k = 3:\n- **pass@3** asks: did at least one of the 3 runs succeed?\n- **pass^3** asks: did all 3 runs succeed?\n\nSo if the results are S, F, S:\n- pass@3 = yes\n- pass^3 = no\n\nIf the results are S, S, S:\n- pass@3 = yes\n- pass^3 = yes\n\nThe build wants the second kind of claim: all runs succeed, because that shows reliability. Want to try one quick practice question?", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluating agents"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pass^k\n[activity] t=24 messages 4m", "t": 28, "activity": [{"t": 24, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.296727034588242, "pomdp": 0.296727034588242, "pass_k": 0.47826736410037957}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.5694114428006399, "motivation": 0.44783718433757524, "reliance": 0.33294461262462643, "persistence": 0.4671650147483821, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.28910681059556054, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3019095011780912, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255224.5291069, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 here\u2019s the direct answer you can use:\n\n**pass^k** means **all k runs must succeed**.\n\nSo for Friday\u2019s build, if you run the system k times, it only counts as passing pass^k if **every single run** works. If even one fails, then pass^k does not hold.\n\nA clean writeup sentence could be:\n\u201cBecause the build requires reliability, we evaluate with pass^k: the system must succeed on all k runs, not just at least one.\u201d", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluating agents"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=28 messages 1m", "t": 29, "activity": [{"t": 28, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.296727034588242, "pomdp": 0.296727034588242, "pass_k": 0.48053257191985155}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.5694114428006399, "motivation": 0.44783718433757524, "reliance": 0.41294461262462645, "persistence": 0.4371650147483821, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.28910681059556054, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3019095011780912, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": []}}
